  "description": "Place m balls into n baskets such that the minimum magnetic force between any two balls is maximized.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1: position.sort((a, b) => a - b);\n2: let low = 1, high = position[n-1] - position[0], ans = 1;\n3: while (low <= high) {\n4:   let mid = Math.floor((low + high) / 2);\n5:   if (canPlace(mid)) { ans = mid; low = mid + 1; }\n6:   else { high = mid - 1; }\n7: }\n8: return ans;",
